        "Content": "<ul><li> Impressive 3 bedroom, 3 bathroom end-of-row semi-detached family home </li><li> Approx. 105 sq.m. (1,130 sq.ft.) of bright, well-proportioned accommodation </li><li> Generous corner site with approx. 4ft side space widening to approx. 8ft, providing significant exte </li><li> Further opportunity to convert the attic, with strong precedent throughout the development (S.P.P.) </li><li> Open-plan kitchen/diner flowing seamlessly into the adjoining sunroom </li><li> Exceptionally private, east-facing rear garden with mature screening and gated side access </li><li> Enviable end-of-cul-de-sac setting directly opposite an expansive open green </li><li> Cobblelock driveway comfortably accommodating three cars </li><li> No onward chain, offering the potential for a straightforward sale </li><li> Built in 1997</li></ul>"
